    narr:narration """This hub tracks the evolution of a [structured async decision platform](narr:Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform) defined explicitly as an alternative to real-time chat tools like Slack or Teams. The positioning, established in March 2026, targets [remote teams of 10-50 people](narr:Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams) experiencing decision-loss. While the initial [pricing model](narr:Position_PricingTwelveDollars) was anchored at $12/user/month, internal records from March 2026 indicate a shift to $15/user for larger cohorts. Recent activity in August 2026 focuses on operational execution, with [TanyaTeamowner](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786528036698_1) reporting the shipment of an async decision widget and linking [velocity gains](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786528036698_2) to the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786528036698_3). The narrative remains anchored in a deliberate rejection of synchronous communication patterns, now supported by concrete delivery milestones.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786528036698_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786528036698_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786528036698_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_PricingTwelveDollars> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_Sprint4VelocityDriver> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Structured async decision platform" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Real-time chat (Slack, Teams) is the named anti-pattern." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We shipped the async decision widget." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786528036698_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "Velocity was 23 points, highest this quarter." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786528036698_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The Zephyr integration was the key unlock." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786528036698_3> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Pricing tension exists between the initial $12 flat rate and the later $15 tier for larger teams." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_PricingTwelveDollars> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Operational focus on velocity metrics may diverge from the high-level category-creation strategy." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_Sprint4VelocityDriver> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1786528036698_2> ] ;
